<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of UK company</p>
<p>results expected in week ending November 08 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, November 06</p>
<p>-- No major companies reporting</p>
