<p> KwikSave	    F   PFT	    85.88    82.0-90.0     125.5</p>
<p>			     DIV	    20.0     14.0-20.0     20.0</p>
<p>			     EPS	    38	   n/a	   n/a</p>
<p> Boots Co Plc	I   PFT	    235.0    225.0-241.0   218.7</p>
<p>			     DIV	    6.2	6.1-6.3	 5.7</p>
<p>			     EPS	    15.27    14.25-16.30   n/a</p>
<p> Burton Group	F   PFT	    144.88   139.0-149.0   98.60</p>
<p>			     DIV	    2.50     2.50-2.80     2.20</p>
<p>			     EPS	    7.37     7.0-7.7	 n/a</p>
<p>FRIDAY, November 08</p>
<p> Unilever	   Q3   PFT	    790.0    760-820	 786.0</p>
<p>			     DIV	    10.3	n/a	     7.05</p>
